<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>tmc-langs-cli third-party notices</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Third-party notices</h1>
  <p>tmc-langs-cli contains the following third-party software.</p>

  <h2>Bundled Java components</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Apache Maven 3.8.1, Apache License 2.0, <a href="https://maven.apache.org/">maven.apache.org</a></li>
    <li>j4rs 0.25.2 with its dependencies, MIT or Apache License 2.0, <a href="https://github.com/astonbitecode/j4rs">github.com/astonbitecode/j4rs</a></li>
    <li>tmc-checkstyle-runner 3.0.3 with its dependencies, including Checkstyle (LGPL-2.1-or-later), and tmc-junit-runner 0.2.8, <a href="https://github.com/testmycode">github.com/testmycode</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Licenses of Rust crates</h2>
  <ul>
    {{#each overview}}
    <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul>
    {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
